-- The point of this deck. Cell 1 is outside the sector and cell 4 is inside
-- it, so this connection crosses the sector boundary without being an axis
-- neighbour of anything. Its transmissibility is deliberately large: it
-- carries about three quarters of the oil entering the sector, so a reduced
-- run that fails to apply it is not slightly wrong but starved.
NNC
  1 1 1  4 1 1  500.0 /
/

FLUXNUM
  2*0 3*1 6*0 /

FLUXTYPE
  FLUX /

DUMPFLUX /


